#: pretix_sattleme/apps.py
msgid ""
"Accept Bitcoin payments, in Lightning or on-chain, paid straight to your "
"sattle.me wallet."
msgstr ""
"Acceptez les paiements en Bitcoin, en Lightning ou on-chain, versés "
"directement sur votre portefeuille sattle.me."

#: pretix_sattleme/apps.py
msgid "Payment"
msgstr "Paiement"

#: pretix_sattleme/apps.py pretix_sattleme/payment.py
msgid "Bitcoin (sattle.me)"
msgstr "Bitcoin (sattle.me)"

#: pretix_sattleme/display.py
msgid ""
"the merchant's relays, its Lightning address, a source of exchange rates or "
"a blockchain explorer did not answer"
msgstr ""
"les relais du marchand, son adresse Lightning, une source de taux de change "
"ou un explorateur de blockchain n'ont pas répondu"

#: pretix_sattleme/display.py
msgid "it took too long"
msgstr "cela a pris trop de temps"

#: pretix_sattleme/display.py
msgid "the integration key is not valid"
msgstr "la clé d'intégration n'est pas valide"

#: pretix_sattleme/display.py
msgid "the integration was removed in the sattle.me app"
msgstr "l'intégration a été supprimée dans l'application sattle.me"

#: pretix_sattleme/display.py
msgid "the integration could not be found on its relays"
msgstr "l'intégration est introuvable sur ses relais"

#: pretix_sattleme/display.py
msgid ""
"the merchant's Lightning address answered with an invoice that failed the "
"checks"
msgstr ""
"l'adresse Lightning du marchand a répondu par une demande de paiement qui "
"n'a pas passé les vérifications"

#: pretix_sattleme/display.py
msgid ""
"the order's amount or currency was refused, or the invoice stored is not "
"valid"
msgstr ""
"le montant ou la devise de la commande a été refusé, ou la demande de "
"paiement enregistrée n'est pas valide"

#: pretix_sattleme/display.py
msgid "no source of exchange rates prices the event's currency"
msgstr "aucune source de taux de change ne cote la devise de l'événement"

#: pretix_sattleme/display.py
msgid "no usable exchange rate could be found"
msgstr "aucun taux de change utilisable n'a été trouvé"

#: pretix_sattleme/display.py
msgid ""
"this amount can only be paid on-chain, and no deposit address of the "
"integration was free"
msgstr ""
"ce montant ne peut être payé qu'on-chain, et aucune adresse de dépôt de "
"l'intégration n'était libre"

#: pretix_sattleme/display.py
msgid ""
"the invoice would have ended after the order's deadline: a clock is off, the "
"merchant's Lightning address's or this server's"
msgstr ""
"la demande de paiement aurait pris fin après le délai de la commande : une "
"horloge est déréglée, celle de l'adresse Lightning du marchand ou celle de "
"ce serveur"

#: pretix_sattleme/display.py
msgid "the invoice handed out was not of the payment's price"
msgstr "la demande de paiement remise n'était pas du prix du paiement"

#: pretix_sattleme/display.py
msgid "pretix could not apply what the check found (see the server's log)"
msgstr ""
"pretix n'a pas pu appliquer le résultat de la vérification (voir le journal "
"du serveur)"

#: pretix_sattleme/display.py
msgid "an unexpected error (see the server's log)"
msgstr "une erreur inattendue (voir le journal du serveur)"

#: pretix_sattleme/display.py
msgid "QR code of the Bitcoin payment"
msgstr "Code QR du paiement Bitcoin"

#: pretix_sattleme/invoices.py
msgid ""
"The time to pay this order is almost over: it cannot be paid with Bitcoin."
msgstr ""
"Le délai de paiement de cette commande est presque écoulé : elle ne peut "
"plus être payée en Bitcoin."

#: pretix_sattleme/invoices.py
msgid ""
"We could not create your Bitcoin invoice right now. Please try again in a "
"moment."
msgstr ""
"Nous n'avons pas pu créer votre demande de paiement Bitcoin pour le moment. "
"Veuillez réessayer dans un instant."

#: pretix_sattleme/invoices.py
msgid "This payment can no longer be made."
msgstr "Ce paiement ne peut plus être effectué."

#: pretix_sattleme/invoices.py
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"An earlier Bitcoin invoice of this order can still be paid, until {time}: a "
"new one can be made once it has ended."
msgstr ""
"Une demande de paiement Bitcoin antérieure de cette commande peut encore "
"être payée, jusqu'à {time} : une nouvelle pourra être créée une fois qu'elle "
"aura pris fin."

#: pretix_sattleme/invoices.py
msgid ""
"The time to pay an earlier Bitcoin invoice of this order is over, and its "
"payment is being checked: a new one can be made once it is known to be "
"unpaid."
msgstr ""
"Le temps pour payer une demande de paiement Bitcoin antérieure de cette "
"commande est écoulé, et son paiement est en cours de vérification : une "
"nouvelle pourra être créée une fois établi qu'elle n'a pas été payée."

#: pretix_sattleme/invoices.py
msgid ""
"A Bitcoin payment of this order awaits the organizer: no other Bitcoin "
"invoice can be made meanwhile. Please contact the organizer."
msgstr ""
"Un paiement Bitcoin de cette commande attend l'organisateur : aucune autre "
"demande de paiement Bitcoin ne peut être créée d'ici là. Veuillez contacter "
"l'organisateur."

#: pretix_sattleme/invoices.py
msgid ""
"A Bitcoin payment of this order has arrived and is being checked: no other "
"Bitcoin invoice can be made meanwhile."
msgstr ""
"Un paiement Bitcoin de cette commande est arrivé et est en cours de "
"vérification : aucune autre demande de paiement Bitcoin ne peut être créée "
"entre-temps."

#: pretix_sattleme/invoices.py
msgid ""
"This order cannot be paid with Bitcoin. Please choose another payment method."
msgstr ""
"Cette commande ne peut pas être payée en Bitcoin. Veuillez choisir un autre "
"mode de paiement."

#: pretix_sattleme/invoices.py
msgid ""
"Bitcoin payments are not available right now. Please choose another payment "
"method or contact the organizer."
msgstr ""
"Les paiements en Bitcoin ne sont pas disponibles pour le moment. Veuillez "
"choisir un autre mode de paiement ou contacter l'organisateur."

#: pretix_sattleme/payment.py
msgid ""
"The Bitcoin invoice of this payment may still be paid: the payment can be "
"canceled once the invoice's final status is known."
msgstr ""
"La demande de paiement Bitcoin de ce paiement peut encore être payée : le "
"paiement pourra être annulé une fois le statut définitif de la demande connu."

#: pretix_sattleme/payment.py
msgid "This is not the secret key of a sattle.me integration (sattleme_ck_…)."
msgstr ""
"Ceci n'est pas la clé secrète d'une intégration sattle.me (sattleme_ck_…)."

#: pretix_sattleme/payment.py
msgid ""
"This integration was removed in the sattle.me app. Create a new one and "
"enter its key."
msgstr ""
"Cette intégration a été supprimée dans l'application sattle.me. Créez-en une "
"nouvelle et saisissez sa clé."

#: pretix_sattleme/payment.py
msgid "This integration needs a newer version of the sattle.me plugin."
msgstr ""
"Cette intégration nécessite une version plus récente du plugin sattle.me."

#: pretix_sattleme/payment.py
msgid ""
"This integration could not be found. Please check the key, or try again in a "
"moment."
msgstr ""
"Cette intégration est introuvable. Veuillez vérifier la clé ou réessayer "
"dans un instant."

#: pretix_sattleme/payment.py
msgid ""
"This key could not be verified: the integration's relays or its Lightning "
"address did not answer. Please try again in a moment."
msgstr ""
"Cette clé n'a pas pu être vérifiée : les relais de l'intégration ou son "
"adresse Lightning n'ont pas répondu. Veuillez réessayer dans un instant."

#: pretix_sattleme/payment.py
msgid "Bitcoin"
msgstr "Bitcoin"

#: pretix_sattleme/payment.py
msgid ""
"sattle.me has no test mode: in test mode too, payments are real bitcoin "
"payments, to the organizer's wallet."
msgstr ""
"sattle.me n'a pas de mode test : même en mode test, les paiements sont de "
"vrais paiements en bitcoin, vers le portefeuille de l'organisateur."

#: pretix_sattleme/payment.py
msgid "Time to pay"
msgstr "Temps pour payer"

#: pretix_sattleme/payment.py
msgid ""
"How many minutes the customer has to pay a Bitcoin invoice, from 1 to 60."
msgstr ""
"Nombre de minutes dont le client dispose pour payer une demande de paiement "
"Bitcoin, de 1 à 60."

#: pretix_sattleme/payment.py
msgid "Payment method name"
msgstr "Nom du mode de paiement"

#: pretix_sattleme/payment.py
msgid ""
"What the customer sees at checkout, on the order's page and in emails. "
"Empty: “Bitcoin”."
msgstr ""
"Ce que le client voit lors de la commande, sur la page de sa commande et "
"dans les e-mails. Vide : « Bitcoin »."

#: pretix_sattleme/payment.py
msgid "Payment process description during checkout"
msgstr "Description du processus de paiement lors du paiement"

#: pretix_sattleme/payment.py
msgid ""
"Shown to the customer who chooses this payment method. Empty: how a Bitcoin "
"payment goes, in the customer's language."
msgstr ""
"Affiché au client qui choisit ce mode de paiement. Vide : le déroulement "
"d'un paiement Bitcoin, dans la langue du client."

#: pretix_sattleme/payment.py
msgid "Integration key"
msgstr "Clé d'intégration"

#: pretix_sattleme/payment.py
msgid ""
"In the sattle.me app, create an integration for this shop and enter its "
"secret key (sattleme_ck_…). Whoever holds it can create invoices that pay "
"you, never spend your funds: keep it secret all the same. Change it only "
"while no Bitcoin payment is pending: those are checked with the key set here."
msgstr ""
"Dans l'application sattle.me, créez une intégration pour cette boutique et "
"saisissez sa clé secrète (sattleme_ck_…). Qui la détient peut créer des "
"demandes de paiement en votre faveur, jamais dépenser vos fonds : gardez-la "
"tout de même secrète. Ne la changez que lorsqu'aucun paiement Bitcoin n'est "
"en attente : ceux-ci sont vérifiés avec la clé saisie ici."

#: pretix_sattleme/payment.py
msgid ""
"To pay with Bitcoin, open your order with the link below: its payment page "
"shows a QR code to scan with your Bitcoin wallet."
msgstr ""
"Pour payer en Bitcoin, ouvrez votre commande avec le lien ci-dessous : sa "
"page de paiement affiche un code QR à scanner avec votre portefeuille "
"Bitcoin."

#: pretix_sattleme/signals.py
#, python-brace-format
msgid "A Bitcoin invoice of {sats} sats was created for payment {local_id}."
msgstr ""
"Une demande de paiement Bitcoin de {sats} sats a été créée pour le paiement "
"{local_id}."

#: pretix_sattleme/signals.py
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"The Bitcoin invoice of {sats} sats made earlier for payment {local_id} was "
"found again in the merchant's registry, and shown again."
msgstr ""
"La demande de paiement Bitcoin de {sats} sats créée plus tôt pour le "
"paiement {local_id} a été retrouvée dans le registre du marchand, et "
"affichée à nouveau."

#: pretix_sattleme/signals.py
#, python-brace-format
msgid "No Bitcoin invoice could be created ({error})."
msgstr "Aucune demande de paiement Bitcoin n'a pu être créée ({error})."

#: pretix_sattleme/signals.py
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"A Bitcoin payment of {received} sats came, and is being confirmed on-chain."
msgstr ""
"Un paiement Bitcoin de {received} sats est arrivé et est en cours de "
"confirmation on-chain."

#: pretix_sattleme/signals.py
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"The Bitcoin invoice ended underpaid: {received} of {sats} sats came, and "
"reached your wallet. Please settle the difference with the customer."
msgstr ""
"La demande de paiement Bitcoin a pris fin sous-payée : {received} sats sur "
"{sats} sont arrivés sur votre portefeuille. Veuillez régler la différence "
"avec le client."

#: pretix_sattleme/signals.py
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"The Bitcoin invoice of payment {local_id} was paid, {amount} ({received} "
"sats), while the order owes {owed} now: it changed after the invoice was "
"made. The payment was not confirmed: please settle the difference with the "
"customer, then confirm it by hand."
msgstr ""
"La demande de paiement Bitcoin du paiement {local_id} a été payée, {amount} "
"({received} sats), alors que la commande doit maintenant {owed} : elle a été "
"modifiée après la création de la demande. Le paiement n'a pas été confirmé : "
"veuillez régler la différence avec le client, puis le confirmer manuellement."

#: pretix_sattleme/signals.py
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"The Bitcoin invoice of payment {local_id} was paid with {received} sats, for "
"an amount of {sats} sats: less is what the merchant accepted in the sattle."
"me app (its tolerance, or by hand), more an overpayment."
msgstr ""
"La demande de paiement Bitcoin du paiement {local_id} a été payée avec "
"{received} sats, pour un montant de {sats} sats : moins correspond à ce que "
"le marchand a accepté dans l'application sattle.me (sa tolérance, ou à la "
"main), plus à un trop-perçu."

#: pretix_sattleme/signals.py
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"The Bitcoin invoice of payment {local_id} had no final status after {days} "
"days: its checks stopped. Please check this payment in the sattle.me app."
msgstr ""
"La demande de paiement Bitcoin du paiement {local_id} n'avait pas de statut "
"définitif après {days} jours : ses vérifications ont été arrêtées. Veuillez "
"vérifier ce paiement dans l'application sattle.me."

#: pretix_sattleme/templates/pretix_sattleme/checkout_payment_confirm.html
msgid ""
"After you confirm your order, you get a QR code to scan with your Bitcoin "
"wallet. Please have your wallet ready: the invoice can be paid for a limited "
"time only."
msgstr ""
"Après avoir confirmé votre commande, vous obtenez un code QR à scanner avec "
"votre portefeuille Bitcoin. Gardez votre portefeuille à portée de main : la "
"demande de paiement ne peut être payée que pendant un temps limité."

#: pretix_sattleme/templates/pretix_sattleme/checkout_payment_form.html
msgid ""
"Pay with your Bitcoin wallet, in Lightning or, depending on the amount, on-"
"chain. Once you have confirmed your order, you get a QR code to scan with "
"your wallet."
msgstr ""
"Payez avec votre portefeuille Bitcoin, en Lightning ou, selon le montant, on-"
"chain. Une fois votre commande confirmée, vous obtenez un code QR à scanner "
"avec votre portefeuille."

#: pretix_sattleme/templates/pretix_sattleme/control.html
msgid "Reference"
msgstr "Référence"

#: pretix_sattleme/templates/pretix_sattleme/control.html
msgid "Status"
msgstr "Statut"

#: pretix_sattleme/templates/pretix_sattleme/control.html
msgid "no invoice made"
msgstr "aucune demande de paiement créée"

#: pretix_sattleme/templates/pretix_sattleme/control.html
#, python-format
msgid "failed: %(error)s"
msgstr "échec : %(error)s"

#: pretix_sattleme/templates/pretix_sattleme/control.html
#: pretix_sattleme/templates/pretix_sattleme/pay.html
msgid "Amount"
msgstr "Montant"

#: pretix_sattleme/templates/pretix_sattleme/control.html
msgid "Exchange rate"
msgstr "Taux de change"

#: pretix_sattleme/templates/pretix_sattleme/control.html
msgid "Payable"
msgstr "Payable"

#: pretix_sattleme/templates/pretix_sattleme/control.html
msgid "in Lightning"
msgstr "en Lightning"

#: pretix_sattleme/templates/pretix_sattleme/control.html
msgid "on-chain"
msgstr "on-chain"

#: pretix_sattleme/templates/pretix_sattleme/control.html
msgid "Payment hash"
msgstr "Hash de paiement"

#: pretix_sattleme/templates/pretix_sattleme/control.html
#: pretix_sattleme/templates/pretix_sattleme/pay.html
msgid "Bitcoin address"
msgstr "Adresse Bitcoin"

#: pretix_sattleme/templates/pretix_sattleme/control.html
msgid "Created"
msgstr "Créée"

#: pretix_sattleme/templates/pretix_sattleme/control.html
msgid "Payable until"
msgstr "Payable jusqu'au"

#: pretix_sattleme/templates/pretix_sattleme/control.html
msgid "paid"
msgstr "payée"

#: pretix_sattleme/templates/pretix_sattleme/control.html
msgid "on-chain and in Lightning"
msgstr "on-chain et en Lightning"

#: pretix_sattleme/templates/pretix_sattleme/control.html
msgid ""
"Not confirmed: the order owed another amount when it was paid (see its "
"history). Settle the difference with the customer, then confirm this payment "
"by hand."
msgstr ""
"Non confirmé : la commande devait un autre montant lors du paiement (voir "
"son historique). Réglez la différence avec le client, puis confirmez ce "
"paiement manuellement."

#: pretix_sattleme/templates/pretix_sattleme/control.html
msgid "received, being confirmed on-chain"
msgstr "reçue, en cours de confirmation on-chain"

#: pretix_sattleme/templates/pretix_sattleme/control.html
msgid "ended underpaid"
msgstr "terminée sous-payée"

#: pretix_sattleme/templates/pretix_sattleme/control.html
msgid "expired unpaid"
msgstr "expirée sans paiement"

#: pretix_sattleme/templates/pretix_sattleme/control.html
msgid ""
"Not confirmed: what came reached your wallet. Settle the difference with the "
"customer, then confirm this payment by hand, or cancel it for the customer "
"to pay again."
msgstr ""
"Non confirmé : ce qui est arrivé a atteint votre portefeuille. Réglez la "
"différence avec le client, puis confirmez ce paiement manuellement, ou "
"annulez-le pour que le client paie à nouveau."

#: pretix_sattleme/templates/pretix_sattleme/control.html
msgid "partly paid, waiting for the rest"
msgstr "payée en partie, en attente du reste"

#: pretix_sattleme/templates/pretix_sattleme/control.html
msgid "waiting for the payment"
msgstr "en attente du paiement"

#: pretix_sattleme/templates/pretix_sattleme/control.html
msgid "not checked yet"
msgstr "pas encore vérifiée"

#: pretix_sattleme/templates/pretix_sattleme/control.html
msgid "Received"
msgstr "Reçu"

#: pretix_sattleme/templates/pretix_sattleme/control.html
msgid "Confirmations"
msgstr "Confirmations"

#: pretix_sattleme/templates/pretix_sattleme/control.html
msgid "Transactions"
msgstr "Transactions"

#: pretix_sattleme/templates/pretix_sattleme/control.html
msgid "Proof of payment"
msgstr "Preuve de paiement"

#: pretix_sattleme/templates/pretix_sattleme/control.html
msgid "Last check"
msgstr "Dernière vérification"

#: pretix_sattleme/templates/pretix_sattleme/control.html
msgid "its checks stopped: no final status after 90 days"
msgstr ""
"ses vérifications ont été arrêtées : pas de statut définitif après 90 jours"

#: pretix_sattleme/templates/pretix_sattleme/control.html
msgid "Next check"
msgstr "Prochaine vérification"

#: pretix_sattleme/templates/pretix_sattleme/pay.html
#: pretix_sattleme/templates/pretix_sattleme/pending.html
msgid "Pay with Bitcoin"
msgstr "Payer en Bitcoin"

#: pretix_sattleme/templates/pretix_sattleme/pay.html
#, python-format
msgid "Pay order %(code)s with Bitcoin"
msgstr "Payer la commande %(code)s en Bitcoin"

#: pretix_sattleme/templates/pretix_sattleme/pay.html
msgid "Scan this QR code with your Bitcoin wallet."
msgstr "Scannez ce code QR avec votre portefeuille Bitcoin."

#: pretix_sattleme/templates/pretix_sattleme/pay.html
msgid "Open in my wallet"
msgstr "Ouvrir dans mon portefeuille"

#: pretix_sattleme/templates/pretix_sattleme/pay.html
#, python-format
msgid ""
"We received %(received)s sats, less than the amount of this order. Please "
"pay the remaining %(rest)s sats."
msgstr ""
"Nous avons reçu %(received)s sats, moins que le montant de cette commande. "
"Veuillez payer les %(rest)s sats restants."

#: pretix_sattleme/templates/pretix_sattleme/pay.html
msgid ""
"An invoice for the remaining amount is being prepared: it appears here in a "
"moment."
msgstr ""
"Une demande de paiement du montant restant est en préparation : elle "
"apparaît ici dans un instant."

#: pretix_sattleme/templates/pretix_sattleme/pay.html
msgid "Remaining amount"
msgstr "Montant restant"

#: pretix_sattleme/templates/pretix_sattleme/pay.html
msgid "Time left to pay"
msgstr "Temps restant pour payer"

#: pretix_sattleme/templates/pretix_sattleme/pay.html
#, python-format
msgid "(until %(time)s)"
msgstr "(jusqu'à %(time)s)"

#: pretix_sattleme/templates/pretix_sattleme/pay.html
msgid "Lightning invoice"
msgstr "Facture Lightning"

#: pretix_sattleme/templates/pretix_sattleme/pay.html
msgid "Copied"
msgstr "Copié"

#: pretix_sattleme/templates/pretix_sattleme/pay.html
msgid "Copy the Lightning invoice"
msgstr "Copier la facture Lightning"

#: pretix_sattleme/templates/pretix_sattleme/pay.html
msgid "Copy the address"
msgstr "Copier l'adresse"

#: pretix_sattleme/templates/pretix_sattleme/pay.html
#, python-format
msgid "To pay on-chain, send exactly %(amount)s BTC to this address."
msgstr ""
"Pour payer on-chain, envoyez exactement %(amount)s BTC à cette adresse."

#: pretix_sattleme/templates/pretix_sattleme/pay.html
msgid "This page updates on its own as soon as your payment arrives."
msgstr "Cette page se met à jour d'elle-même dès que votre paiement arrive."

#: pretix_sattleme/templates/pretix_sattleme/pay.html
msgid ""
"A payment on-chain is confirmed by the Bitcoin network in about 30 minutes: "
"once it has arrived, you can close this page."
msgstr ""
"Un paiement on-chain est confirmé par le réseau Bitcoin en 30 minutes "
"environ : une fois qu'il est arrivé, vous pouvez fermer cette page."

#: pretix_sattleme/templates/pretix_sattleme/pay.html
#: pretix_sattleme/templates/pretix_sattleme/pending.html
msgid "Your payment has arrived: your order is being updated."
msgstr ""
"Votre paiement est arrivé : votre commande est en cours de mise à jour."

#: pretix_sattleme/templates/pretix_sattleme/pay.html
msgid "You can close this page: your order's page shows its status."
msgstr ""
"Vous pouvez fermer cette page : la page de votre commande indique son statut."

#: pretix_sattleme/templates/pretix_sattleme/pay.html
#: pretix_sattleme/templates/pretix_sattleme/pending.html
msgid ""
"Your Bitcoin payment has arrived, but your order changed after its invoice "
"was made: the organizer settles the difference with you, then confirms your "
"payment."
msgstr ""
"Votre paiement Bitcoin est arrivé, mais votre commande a été modifiée après "
"la création de sa demande de paiement : l'organisateur règle la différence "
"avec vous, puis confirme votre paiement."

#: pretix_sattleme/templates/pretix_sattleme/pay.html
msgid "Your payment has arrived: it is being confirmed."
msgstr "Votre paiement est arrivé : il est en cours de confirmation."

#: pretix_sattleme/templates/pretix_sattleme/pay.html
#, python-format
msgid ""
"It is being confirmed by the Bitcoin network: %(count)s of 3 confirmations. "
"This usually takes about 30 minutes, after which your order is marked as "
"paid."
msgstr ""
"Le paiement est en cours de confirmation par le réseau Bitcoin : %(count)s "
"sur 3 confirmations. Cela prend en général environ 30 minutes, après quoi "
"votre commande est marquée comme payée."

#: pretix_sattleme/templates/pretix_sattleme/pay.html
msgid "The time to pay this invoice is over."
msgstr "Le temps pour payer cette demande de paiement est écoulé."

#: pretix_sattleme/templates/pretix_sattleme/pay.html
msgid ""
"If you paid it in time, your payment is being checked: this page updates on "
"its own."
msgstr ""
"Si vous l'avez payée à temps, votre paiement est en cours de vérification : "
"cette page se met à jour d'elle-même."

#: pretix_sattleme/templates/pretix_sattleme/pay.html
#, python-format
msgid ""
"This invoice ended before it was fully paid: we received %(received)s of "
"%(sats)s sats. Please contact the organizer to settle the difference."
msgstr ""
"Cette demande de paiement a pris fin avant d'être entièrement payée : nous "
"avons reçu %(received)s sats sur %(sats)s. Veuillez contacter l'organisateur "
"pour régler la différence."

#: pretix_sattleme/templates/pretix_sattleme/pay.html
msgid ""
"This invoice expired without being paid. You can pay again from your order's "
"page."
msgstr ""
"Cette demande de paiement a expiré sans être payée. Vous pouvez payer à "
"nouveau depuis la page de votre commande."

#: pretix_sattleme/templates/pretix_sattleme/pay.html
msgid ""
"This payment was canceled. Your order's page shows how to pay your order."
msgstr ""
"Ce paiement a été annulé. La page de votre commande indique comment la payer."

#: pretix_sattleme/templates/pretix_sattleme/pay.html
msgid "Back to your order"
msgstr "Retour à votre commande"

#: pretix_sattleme/templates/pretix_sattleme/pay.html
msgid "Check the payment"
msgstr "Vérifier le paiement"

#: pretix_sattleme/templates/pretix_sattleme/pending.html
msgid "Your Bitcoin invoice is waiting for your payment."
msgstr "Votre demande de paiement Bitcoin attend votre paiement."

#: pretix_sattleme/templates/pretix_sattleme/pending.html
#, python-format
msgid ""
"To pay with another method, please wait until this invoice has ended, at "
"%(time)s: it can be paid until then."
msgstr ""
"Pour payer avec un autre moyen, veuillez attendre la fin de cette demande de "
"paiement, à %(time)s : elle peut être payée jusque-là."

#: pretix_sattleme/templates/pretix_sattleme/pending.html
#, python-format
msgid ""
"We received %(received)s sats, less than the amount of your order: please "
"pay the rest."
msgstr ""
"Nous avons reçu %(received)s sats, moins que le montant de votre commande : "
"veuillez payer le reste."

#: pretix_sattleme/templates/pretix_sattleme/pending.html
msgid "Pay the rest with Bitcoin"
msgstr "Payer le reste en Bitcoin"

#: pretix_sattleme/templates/pretix_sattleme/pending.html
msgid ""
"Your Bitcoin payment has arrived. It is being confirmed by the Bitcoin "
"network, which usually takes about 30 minutes: your order is then marked as "
"paid."
msgstr ""
"Votre paiement Bitcoin est arrivé. Il est en cours de confirmation par le "
"réseau Bitcoin, ce qui prend en général environ 30 minutes : votre commande "
"sera ensuite marquée comme payée."

#: pretix_sattleme/templates/pretix_sattleme/pending.html
msgid ""
"The time to pay your Bitcoin invoice is over. If you paid it in time, your "
"payment is being checked."
msgstr ""
"Le temps pour payer votre demande de paiement Bitcoin est écoulé. Si vous "
"l'avez payée à temps, votre paiement est en cours de vérification."

#: pretix_sattleme/templates/pretix_sattleme/pending.html
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Your Bitcoin invoice ended before it was fully paid: we received "
"%(received)s of %(sats)s sats. Please contact the organizer to settle the "
"difference."
msgstr ""
"Votre demande de paiement Bitcoin a pris fin avant d'être entièrement "
"payée : nous avons reçu %(received)s sats sur %(sats)s. Veuillez contacter "
"l'organisateur pour régler la différence."

#: pretix_sattleme/templates/pretix_sattleme/pending.html
msgid "Your Bitcoin invoice expired without being paid."
msgstr "Votre demande de paiement Bitcoin a expiré sans être payée."

#: pretix_sattleme/templates/pretix_sattleme/settings.html
#, python-format
msgid ""
"This event's currency, %(currency)s, is not one sattle.me prices orders in: "
"the payment method is not offered to customers."
msgstr ""
"La devise de cet événement, %(currency)s, ne fait pas partie des devises "
"dans lesquelles sattle.me facture les commandes : le mode de paiement n'est "
"pas proposé aux clients."

#: pretix_sattleme/templates/pretix_sattleme/settings.html
#, python-format
msgid ""
"sattle.me prices orders in %(currency)s in whole units: the payment method "
"is offered to customers only for amounts without decimals."
msgstr ""
"sattle.me facture les commandes en %(currency)s en unités entières : le mode "
"de paiement n'est proposé aux clients que pour des montants sans décimales."

#: pretix_sattleme/templates/pretix_sattleme/settings.html
msgid ""
"Customers pay with a QR code: in Lightning, and on-chain from 1,000 sats "
"when your integration has deposit addresses in the sattle.me app. The "
"bitcoin goes straight to your sattle.me wallet."
msgstr ""
"Les clients paient avec un code QR : en Lightning, et on-chain à partir de 1 "
"000 sats lorsque votre intégration dispose d'adresses de dépôt dans "
"l'application sattle.me. Les bitcoins arrivent directement sur votre "
"portefeuille sattle.me."

#: pretix_sattleme/templates/pretix_sattleme/settings.html
msgid ""
"Payments are checked in the background: pretix's task workers and its "
"periodic tasks must run. An on-chain payment counts once it has 3 "
"confirmations, which takes about 30 minutes."
msgstr ""
"Les paiements sont vérifiés en arrière-plan : les workers de tâches et les "
"tâches périodiques de pretix doivent tourner. Un paiement on-chain compte "
"dès qu'il a 3 confirmations, soit environ 30 minutes."

#: pretix_sattleme/templates/pretix_sattleme/settings.html
msgid ""
"Refunds are not automatic: refund your customers from your wallet, then "
"record the refund in pretix."
msgstr ""
"Les remboursements ne sont pas automatiques : remboursez vos clients depuis "
"votre portefeuille, puis enregistrez le remboursement dans pretix."
